# Runtime logs and caches. Both spellings: the project rename moved the app to
# .mm-*, and an install that ran the older build still has .gev-* on disk. The
# realtime log holds voice conversation text — it must never reach a commit.
.gev-logs/
.gev-cache/
.mm-logs/
.mm-cache/
.DS_Store
.gstack/
3d-models/

# Desktop launcher runtime artefacts (app/ scripts themselves are tracked)
app/browser-profile/
app/GodsEyeView.ico

# Claude Code workspace. launch.json describes how to run THIS project and is
# tracked; settings.local.json is per-machine (it records the commands approved
# on one checkout, absolute paths included) and grows every time another is
# approved, so it would otherwise show up as a permanent pending change.
.claude/settings.local.json
